# Project: Pingly - SMS & Messenger Marketing Platform

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js 14 (App Router)
- UI Library: shadcn/ui
- Styling: Tailwind CSS
- Language: TypeScript (strict mode)
- Database: PostgreSQL + Prisma ORM
- State: Zustand + TanStack Query

## Design System Rules

### Component Usage (MANDATORY)
- Buttons: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/button`
- Cards: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/card`
- Forms: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/form` + react-hook-form
- Modals: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/dialog`
- Inputs: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/input`
- Selects: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/select`
- Loading: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/skeleton`
- Empty State: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/states/empty-state`
- Error State: ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/states/error-state`

### Color Rules (NEVER hardcode)
- Background: `bg-background` (NOT `bg-white`)
- Text: `text-foreground` (NOT `text-gray-900`)
- Primary: `bg-primary text-primary-foreground` (NOT `bg-blue-500`)
- Muted: `text-muted-foreground` (NOT `text-gray-500`)
- Destructive: `bg-destructive` (NOT `bg-red-500`)

### Spacing Standards
- Component gap: `space-y-4` or `gap-4`
- Section padding: `py-8` or `py-16`
- Card padding: `p-6`
- Container: `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8`

### Typography
- h1: `text-2xl font-bold` → `md:text-3xl` → `lg:text-4xl`
- h2: `text-xl font-semibold` → `md:text-2xl`
- body: `text-base text-foreground`
- caption: `text-sm text-muted-foreground`

## Responsive Design (MOBILE-FIRST MANDATORY)

### Breakpoint Order
Always write in this order: base → sm → md → lg → xl
```tsx
// CORRECT
className="w-full md:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3"
className="flex-col md:flex-row"
className="p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8"

// WRONG (desktop-first)
className="w-1/3 lg:w-1/2 md:w-full"
```

### Allowed Breakpoints
- default: < 640px (mobile)
- md: 768px+ (tablet)
- lg: 1024px+ (desktop)
- Avoid sm, xl, 2xl unless necessary

### Touch Targets
- Minimum 44x44px: `min-h-11 min-w-11`
- Icon buttons: `size="icon"` with proper aria-label

## UI State Implementation (REQUIRED)

### Every data component MUST have:
1. Loading: Skeleton UI (NOT Spinner)
2. Success: Actual content
3. Empty: EmptyState component with CTA
4. Error: ErrorState component with retry

### Pattern:
```tsx
if (isLoading) return <Skeleton />
if (isError) return <ErrorState onRetry={refetch} message={error.message} />
if (!data?.length) return <EmptyState icon={Icon} title="..." action={{...}} />
return <Content data={data} />
```

## Accessibility (REQUIRED)

- Images: meaningful `alt` (NOT "image" or empty)
- Forms: `<label>` connected to inputs
- Buttons: clear text OR `aria-label`
- Focus: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring`
- Contrast: 4.5:1 minimum

## PROHIBITED

- Inline styles (`style={{}}`)
- `!important`
- Hardcoded colors (`bg-white`, `text-gray-900`)
- Creating components that exist in ui/
- Desktop-first breakpoints
- Missing loading/error/empty states
- Images without alt text
- Buttons without accessible labels
